  "parked": {
    "reason": "Unlisted, not withdrawn. Both titles pin the SCPH-5552 (PAL) BIOS backend, which the launcher's build path does not support yet: psx_generated_ready() / bios_generated_present() only recognise OpenBIOS_dispatch.c and SCPH1001_dispatch.c, the SDK harvest drops bios/SCPH5552.toml and recompiler/seeds/phase2_ghidra_seeds_SCPH5552.json, and psxrecomp_cli.py 'generate --bios' stages every dump as bios/SCPH1001.BIN and regenerates from bios/SCPH1001.toml. Installing either one leaves an install folder with no launch binary. Manifests stay on disk and ship in catalog.zip; to un-park, re-add each id to platforms.<p>.titles, rebuild titles[] as the platform lists concatenated, and drop the entry from here.",
    "since": "2026-09-10",
    "titles": {
      "alien-resurrection-psx": {
        "platform": "psx",
        "manifest": "titles/psx/alien-resurrection-psx.json"
      },
